<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12192] visorcmd hangs if you ^D to quit</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12192</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;You can exit most Unix utilities by pressing ^D. However, if you do that in ignitevisorcmd when you&apos;re connected to a cluster, the process hangs. You have to press ^C to quit. (It does work as expected if you close the connection first.)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13257378">IGNITE-12192</key>
